{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04274","headline":"咏怀 · 骆宾王","name":"咏怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"少年识事浅，不知交道难。\n一言芬若桂，四海臭如兰。\n宝剑思存楚，金鎚许报韩。\n虚心徒有托，循迹谅无端。\n太息关山险，吁嗟岁月阑。\n忘机殊会俗，守拙异怀安。\n阮籍空长啸，刘琨独未懽。\n十步庭芳敛，三秋陇月团。\n槐疎非尽意，松晚夜凌寒。\n悲调弦中急，穷愁醉里宽。\n莫将流水引，空向俗人弹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04274.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04274","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}